  "observations": [
    {
      "id": "default_interpreter_ignores_requires_python",
      "severity": "note for WP11e and Gate 2",
      "detail": "The wheel declares Requires-Python <3.14,>=3.12. Left to choose for itself, uv 0.10.2 (Homebrew 2026-02-10) built the tool environment on 3.14.3, which the package says it does not support. All five commands pass on it anyway, so this is not a release stop, but a clean-machine install can land on an interpreter outside the tested range without saying so. The second install pins 3.12 and is the supported path. Unchanged from the pre-0026 report: the same host, the same uv, the same outcome."
    }
